// The game will let you try to add no spells
// to empty spellsets (that's what happens with
// Kain's $01 empty/unused spellset), so
// we can simply extend spellsets out to the max
// without consequence, to allow for easy 
// spellset addition in the future.
// note that in rom.py, the MAX_SPELLSETS value
// has been set to 20 already (changed from vanilla FE)
patch($15c271 bus) { E0 } // 20 * 24 = 480 = 0x1E0